    "created_at": "2026-11-12T12:32:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-12T12:32:48Z",
    "body": "Some AI exploration gives two pragmatic choices:\n\n1. Replace U+000D with `&#xD;` in \"update data from attributes\".\n2. Do nothing and let U+000D get normalized away.\n\nI would be okay with 2 as this is not a new issue with PIs.",
